/* Lecture Mastery visual geometry is deliberately matched to the approved
   Visual Atlas viewport behavior. Keep the SVG coordinate system unchanged;
   constrain the complete viewport inside the available box so the Position axis
   begins at the same visible inset as it does in Visual Atlas. */
#functionalContentView .mastery-topic-overview .physics-visual-render has no static match, but an exact selector token is mentioned in embedded JavaScript. The reference may be conditional or string-based; verify the relevant workflow before changing it.

/* Single general Lecture Mastery tab system: all action tabs use the
   existing Translate-tab geometry; no per-button positioning hacks. */
#functionalContentView .mastery-topic-actions .topic-translate-btn has no static match, but an exact selector token is mentioned in embedded JavaScript. The reference may be conditional or string-based; verify the relevant workflow before changing it.

/* Keep every academic topic's existing translation action at the upper-right,
   using the exact 108 x 31 px action-tab geometry used by Lecture Mastery. */
#topicContentView .english-study-toolbar has no static match, but an exact selector token is mentioned in embedded JavaScript. The reference may be conditional or string-based; verify the relevant workflow before changing it.

